{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Understand the two-pass layout used by stacks and other layout containers."}],"metadata":{"title":"Layout System","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/layoutsystem"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ProposedSize","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ViewSize","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/VStack","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/HStack","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Spacer","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderCycle"]},{"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit uses a two-pass layout system inspired by SwiftUI’s layout protocol. Layout containers like ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/VStack"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/HStack"},{"text":" first ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"measure","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" each child, then ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"render"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" them with allocated sizes. This approach enables features like flexible spacers, proportional sizing, and proper alignment.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"The-Two-Passes","text":"The Two Passes","level":2},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Pass-1-Measure","text":"Pass 1: Measure","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The parent proposes a size to each child via ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ProposedSize"},{"text":". Each child responds with a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ViewSize"},{"text":" that describes how much space it needs and whether it can flex.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Parent (VStack)","  ├─ propose(width: 40, height: nil) → Text    → ViewSize(10, 1, flexible: false)","  ├─ propose(width: 40, height: nil) → Spacer  → ViewSize(0, 0, flexible: true)","  └─ propose(width: 40, height: nil) → Button  → ViewSize(12, 1, flexible: false)"],"syntax":null},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Pass-2-Render","text":"Pass 2: Render","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After measuring all children, the parent distributes the remaining space among flexible children and renders each child with its final allocated size."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Parent allocates:","  Text   → render(width: 40, height: 1)   \/\/ Gets full width, fixed height","  Spacer → render(width: 40, height: 8)   \/\/ Gets remaining vertical space","  Button → render(width: 40, height: 1)   \